    "nextSteps": [
      "Prove the q-binomial theorem prod_{i<n}(1+q^i x)=sum_k q^{C(k,2)}[n choose k]_q x^k by induction (peel first factor, substitute x->qx, match via q-Pascal and C(k+1,2)=C(k,2)+k).",
      "Formalize the box-partition generating function and show it satisfies the same recurrence (combinatorial interpretation).",
      "Prove symmetry [n choose k]_q = [n choose n-k]_q and the q-factorial product formula over Z[q]."
